# The ADR index is append-only, one line per ADR (ADR-0034). Two branches that
# each add an ADR append at the same spot; a local merge, cherry-pick or rebase
# (Landing's replay) keeps both lines instead of stopping on a conflict (#235).
# GitHub's merge ignores this, so same-number ADRs still conflict there, and
# check-adr catches a duplicate or out-of-order line the union leaves.
docs/adr/README.md merge=union
